  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-69-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Harmonization of vocational training with labor market needs - SV</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Zosuladenie odborneho vzdelavania s potrebami prac. trhu - &#x160;N</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: xx-small;&quot;&gt;Cez &lt;span style=&quot;font-size: x-small;&quot;&gt;program&lt;/span&gt; CETIR bola v&#xa0;r.2011 &#xfa;spe&#x161;ne realizovan&#xe1; n&#xe1;v&#x161;teva 3 predstavite&#x13e;ov &#xda;nie zamestn&#xe1;vate&#x13e;ov Srbska.&#xa0;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: xx-small;&quot;&gt;T&#xe1;to iniciat&#xed;va na financovanie &#x161;tudijnej cesty vypl&#xfd;va z&#xa0;&#xfa;spe&#x161;nej implement&#xe1;cie Twinningov&#xe9;ho projektu &#x201e;Podpora soci&#xe1;lneho dial&#xf3;gu&#x201c; SR 12 IB SO 01, ktor&#xfd; v&#xa0;s&#xfa;&#x10d;asnosti v&#xa0;Srbsku implementuje Ministerstvo pr&#xe1;ce, soci&#xe1;lnych vec&#xed; a&#xa0;rodiny SR a Region&#xe1;lna rozvojov&#xe1; agent&#xfa;ra Senec-Pezinok. &#xda;nia zamestn&#xe1;vate&#x13e;ov Srbska je jedn&#xfd;m z&#xa0;partnerov projektu. V&#xa0;novembri minul&#xe9;ho roku sa z&#xa0;projektu financovala &#x161;tudijn&#xe1; cesta pre v&#x161;etk&#xfd;ch soci&#xe1;lnych partnerov, bola v&#x161;ak zameran&#xe1; na ot&#xe1;zky soci&#xe1;lneho dial&#xf3;gu.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;in 2011 was through CETIR&#xa0;program&#xa0;successfully implemented&#xa0;visit of&#xa0;three representatives of Union of Employers of Serbia. The initiative to finance the study&#xa0;visit follows the successful implementation of the twinning project &quot;Support to social dialogue&quot; SR 12 IB SO 01, which is currently implemented in Serbia Ministry of Labour, Social Affairs and Family and the Regional Development Agency Senec-Pezinok. Union of Employers of Serbia is one of the project partners. In November last year, the projects funded study&#xa0;visit for all the social partners, but it was focused on issues of social dialogue.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
